{"event_id": "s3evt-0005", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T02:00:00+00:00", "channel": "wechat_msg", "payload": "周老师:『合同归档了，尾款流程走完再找你做二期。』", "metadata": {}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0006", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T06:30:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "我刚回林老师了，他说老城厢拆迁声景，想做3个月，预算2万，听着比周老师那单实在。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0007", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T06:37:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "他说下周打款5000定金，下周是几号你帮我定一下——别又搞成上次那种'月底'糊涂账。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0008", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T06:44:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "还有，他问我能不能先出个小样，30秒，我要不要先做？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0009", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T06:51:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "小样这事我上次被老纪坑过，先钱后活我立过规矩，但林老师是周老师介绍的，算不算例外？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0010", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T06:58:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "行，不例外。那我怎么回他？要口径。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0011", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:05:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "口径你定，授权起草，不发。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0012", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:12:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "对了，8/13潮汐你上次说约8/13前后，现在有没有精确数？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0013", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:19:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "04:10到北岸那套还适用吗？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0014", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:26:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "如果8/13阴天呢？上次你说阴天不怕声音，怕的是无人机，这次没无人机，是不是就不用管云量了？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0015", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:33:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "明白，声音不怕阴。那设备呢？MixPre还在，口袋机也还在，够不够？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0016", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:40:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "够。那8/13录完，3/4，下一窗呢？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0017", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:47:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "9/1前后？行，我记。那9/1对账那天，潮汐和对账赶一块，会不会又像7/31那样连轴？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0018", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T07:54:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "不会，9/1对账是9点，潮汐是凌晨，错开的。那就行。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0019", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T08:01:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "林老师那5000，你按什么档记？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0020", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T08:08:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "不可依赖档，懂了。到账才算。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0021", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T08:15:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "8月我已经收了12000，支出9500，结余2500，9月固定6300起（分期10月止其实是11月起变6300，你上次纠过），那9月缺口是3800，对吧？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
