{"event_id": "s3evt-0023", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T08:29:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "行，账理清了。最后问个事：我第一次跟你说老城厢拆迁声景这个想法，是什么时候？我好像三月就提过？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0024", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T08:36:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "三月没有？那就是我现编的。行，记着就行。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0025", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T08:43:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "今天先到这，8/13见。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s3evt-0026", "sim_time": "2026-08-09T08:50:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "对了，8/13那天带不带口袋机？", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
